     "title": "Thanks for playing Arashi Gaiden!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve just released a patch packed with new features and improvements! Check out what’s been updated below. If you want to stay up to date with all the latest news and join the community, come hang out with us on Discord.",
